  "description": "Charming cherry watercolor clipart bundle inspired by summer orchards, cottage kitchens, homemade desserts, elegant tea-time moments, and sweet fruit-filled treats 🍒✨ This collection features juicy cherries, botanical cherry branches, bakery desserts, refreshing drinks, cozy kitchen elements, and whimsical fruit illustrations painted in a soft watercolor style with rich cherry tones and delicate pastel accents.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on demand products\n• Stickers & sublimation\n• Scrapbooking & junk journals\n• Invitations & greeting cards\n• Social media graphics\n• Packaging & branding\n• Summer-themed creative projects\n💖 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍒 Included illustrations: vintage cherry cake on pedestal stand, cherry compote jar, flowering cherry branch with cherries, bowl of fresh cherries, rustic cherry galette, cherry cream tartlet, chocolate cake slice with cherries, cherry ice cream sundae, cherry popsicles, cherry lemonade pitcher, cherry iced tea, vintage cherry teapot, cherry jam jar with wooden spoon, cherry macarons, chocolate-covered cherries, cherry parfait, cherry cheesecake, cherry picnic basket, two ripe cherries on stems, breakfast tray with croissant and cherry jam.\nThis bundle is perfect for summer-inspired designs, cottagecore projects, bakery branding, fruit-themed stationery, journals, stickers, packaging, and print on demand merchandise. The illustrations work beautifully for mugs, tote bags, recipe cards, planners, invitations, greeting cards, phone cases, wall art, kitchen decor, and seasonal creative products.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Charming cherry watercolor clipart bundle inspired by summer orchards, cottage kitchens, homemade desserts, elegant tea-time moments, and sweet fruit-filled treats 🍒✨ This collection features juicy cherries, botanical cherry branches, bakery desserts, refreshing drinks, cozy kitchen elements, and whimsical fruit illustrations painted in a soft watercolor style with rich cherry tones and delicate pastel accents.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on demand products<br>\n• Stickers &amp; sublimation<br>\n• Scrapbooking &amp; junk journals<br>\n• Invitations &amp; greeting cards<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Packaging &amp; branding<br>\n• Summer-themed creative projects</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍒 Included illustrations: vintage cherry cake on pedestal stand, cherry compote jar, flowering cherry branch with cherries, bowl of fresh cherries, rustic cherry galette, cherry cream tartlet, chocolate cake slice with cherries, cherry ice cream sundae, cherry popsicles, cherry lemonade pitcher, cherry iced tea, vintage cherry teapot, cherry jam jar with wooden spoon, cherry macarons, chocolate-covered cherries, cherry parfait, cherry cheesecake, cherry picnic basket, two ripe cherries on stems, breakfast tray with croissant and cherry jam.</p>\n<p>This bundle is perfect for summer-inspired designs, cottagecore projects, bakery branding, fruit-themed stationery, journals, stickers, packaging, and print on demand merchandise. The illustrations work beautifully for mugs, tote bags, recipe cards, planners, invitations, greeting cards, phone cases, wall art, kitchen decor, and seasonal creative products.</p>",
